OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1785178108
OL,3,COne person killed and several injured
OL,4,Cafter car drives into Berlin pride
OL,5,Ccrowd
OL,7,FA car drove into a crowd during
OL,8,FBerlin's famed LGBTQ+ parade on
OL,9,FSaturday, killing one person and
OL,10,Finjuring at least 15, prompting police
OL,11,Fto call off the event in the German
OL,12,Fcapital hours after it had begun.
OL,14,FPolice said some of the victims had
OL,15,Flife-threatening injuries.
OL,16,FFirefighters and ambulances were out
OL,17,Fwith many emergency staffers at the
OL,18,Fscene to attend to the victims.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/5
