PN,31702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1785178108
OL,3,COne person killed and several injured
OL,4,Cafter car drives into Berlin pride
OL,5,Ccrowd
OL,7,FPolice, who did not say how many were
OL,8,Finjured, called on everyone in a post
OL,9,Fon X to leave the premises of the
OL,10,Fevent immediately.
OL,12,FA short while later, police said a car
OL,13,Fhad driven into the Tiergarten park,
OL,14,Fnear the route of the pride march,
OL,15,Fhitting several people.
OL,17,FPolice did not know how many officers
OL,18,Fhad been deployed to the scene but
OL,19,Fthat it was "definitely a lot of
OL,20,Fpolice." They said they were searching
OL,21,Ffor suspects.
OL,26,@{D@MOU|D@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/5
