PN,31703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1785178108
OL,3,COne person killed and several injured
OL,4,Cafter car drives into Berlin pride
OL,5,Ccrowd
OL,7,F"We are conducting an intensive search
OL,8,Ffor possible suspects," a police
OL,9,Fofficer said on a short video released
OL,10,Fon the Berlin police account on X.
OL,12,FWhile the exact number of injured
OL,13,Fpeople wasn't immediately clear,
OL,14,Fpolice said that several people were
OL,15,Fseverely injured, and that some of
OL,16,Fthem suffered life-threatening
OL,17,Finjuries. Firefighters and ambulances
OL,18,Fwere out with many emergency staffers
OL,19,Fat the park to attend to the victims.
OL,26,@oD@AOUpD@WO]
