OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1785178108
OL,3,COne person killed and several injured
OL,4,Cafter car drives into Berlin pride
OL,5,Ccrowd
OL,7,FHundreds of thousands of people had
OL,8,Fcome to Berlin on Saturday to
OL,9,Fcelebrate at Berlin's pride parade,
OL,10,Fknown in Germany as Christopher Street
OL,11,FDay. It's one of Europe's largest
OL,12,FLGBTQ+ celebrations.
OL,14,FThe pride event in front of the city's
OL,15,Ficonic Brandenburg Gate in downtown
OL,16,Fwas called off around 10:15 p.m. and a
OL,17,Fband's performance on stage was
OL,18,Finterrupted.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/5
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
