PN,31705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1785178108
OL,3,COne person killed and several injured
OL,4,Cafter car drives into Berlin pride
OL,5,Ccrowd
OL,7,FPeople were urged to go home and to
OL,8,Favoid taking the route through the
OL,9,FTiergarten park.
OL,11,FBefore the incident, people had
OL,12,Fcelebrated peacefully, marching
OL,13,Fthrough the city for hours, dancing to
OL,14,Floud music, and cheering the around 80
OL,15,Ffloats that participated in the parade.
